Setting Property Location
*************************
1)Copy and paste properties folder in your system (ex: /home (for linux Users) and C:\ (for Windows Users))

2)For To Run SourceleadCleanInitDatabase and SourceleadDatabaseInstallation Java Files set run configuration arguments 
    
    2.1) Right click on respective File and click "Run Configuration" link 
    
    2.2) Arguments--->VM Arguments---> -DpropertyLocation="file:/home/properties/" (adjust according to your "properties folder location")

 3) For to start tomcat server 
     open launch configuration(double click on server in your respective IDE) ---->Arguments --- > VM Arguments --- > Append this line
      -DpropertyLocation="file:/home/properties/"
      